sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Researcher
  actor A as Approver
  participant X as Extractor (rules / LLM)
  participant C as Compiler + SQL guard
  participant DB as PostgreSQL (read-only role)
  R->>X: natural-language request
  X-->>R: CohortDefinition (allowlisted) + mentions + unsupported phrases
  R->>C: create draft (edited definition)
  C->>C: compile → parameterized SQL, sqlglot AST checks
  C->>DB: EXPLAIN as cliniq_reader
  C-->>R: draft + SQL + sha256 + validation report
  A->>C: approve(sql_sha256 they reviewed)
  Note over C: rejects if hash ≠ current SQL
  R->>C: execute
  C->>C: recompile, refuse if hash ≠ approved
  C->>DB: SELECT in READ ONLY transaction with statement timeout
  DB-->>C: per-patient evidence per criterion
  C-->>R: eligible / potentially eligible / ineligible, funnel, missing info, distributions, result hash
